[al:新概念英语第二册]
[ti:Across the Channel]
[00:00.84]What is Debbie going to try to do? | 黛比将要尝试做什么？
[00:13.66]Debbie Hart is going to swim | 黛比·哈特将于
[00:17.01]across the English Channel tomorrow. | 明天横渡英吉利海峡。
[00:19.88]She is going to set out from the French coast | 她将于明天凌晨5点
[00:23.40]at five o'clock in the morning. | 从法国海岸出发。
[00:25.97]Debbie is only eleven years old | 黛比年仅11岁，
[00:29.60]and she hopes to set up a new world record. | 她希望能创造一个新的世界纪录。
[00:32.96]She is a strong swimmer and many people feel | 她是一名出色的游泳运动员，许多人觉得
[00:36.91]that she is sure to succeed. | 她一定会成功。
[00:39.55]Debbie's father will set out with her | 黛比的父亲将与她一起
[00:42.72]in a small boat. | 乘一艘小船出发。
[00:44.48]Mr. Hart has trained his daughter for years. | 哈特先生训练他的女儿已经多年了。
[00:48.75]Tomorrow he will be watching her anxiously | 明天，他将焦急地看着她
[00:52.54]as she swims the long distance to England. | 游过那漫长的距离去英国。
[00:56.08]Debbie intends to take short rests every two hours. | 黛比打算每两小时短暂停歇一次。
[01:01.34]She will have something to drink | 她会喝些东西，
[01:03.62]but she will not eat any solid food. | 但不吃任何固体食物。
[01:07.06]Most of Debbie's school friends will be | 黛比的大部分同学都将
[01:10.17]waiting for her on the English coast. | 在英国海岸等候她。
[01:13.18]Among them will be Debbie's mother, | 其中包括黛比的母亲，
[01:15.87]who swam the Channel herself | 她本人在还是个女孩的时候
[01:18.21]when she was a girl. | 也曾游过英吉利海峡。